这正是主动驱动的典型特征
Okay, very typical of initiative drive.

56
00:03:52,050 --> 00:03:57,610
驱动-吸收-驱动-吸收，不断循环
It does tend to drive, absorb, drive, absorb, drive, absorb, drive, absorb, drive, absorb.

57
00:03:57,610 --> 00:04:01,753
我们看到这一驱动与吸收的过程正在发生下一次回调，再次驱动，吸收更高
So we've seen this process of driving and absorption in the moment

58
00:04:01,753 --> 00:04:04,515
and again, the next rotation, we drive again

59
00:04:04,515 --> 00:04:06,586
and we're seeing the higher absorption.

60
00:04:11,591 --> 00:04:17,922
in terms of the strategy and once the market had shown us that initiative drive,

61
00:04:17,922 --> 00:04:21,721
we would then be looking for an entry point.

63
00:04:21,723 --> 00:04:25,815
但我们没有详细讲解具体入场点
Now, what we didn't really go over was exact entry points,

64
00:04:25,815 --> 00:04:29,535
这就是主动驱动的棘手之处。
and this is the tricky part about an initiative drive.

65
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:34,030
入场方式有很多种。
There's a number of ways you can get in.

66
00:04:34,090 --> 00:04:37,430
你要理解市场的激进本质，但问题是，入场点并不总是依赖精确的技术区域。
You understand the aggressive nature on the market,

67
00:04:37,430 --> 00:04:44,110
but the problem is that the entry point isn't always dependent on an exact technical area.

68
00:04:44,930 --> 00:04:48,315
现在，关键是我们要寻找区域。
Now, what is crucial is we want to look for regions.

69
00:04:48,315 --> 00:04:50,469
这就是我们要找的。
So that's what we're trying to find.

70
00:04:50,469 --> 00:04:54,469
我们要找能提供入场机会的区域。
We're trying to find regions that ultimately could give us opportunity for entry.

