现在看当前的例子，可以看到一个区域肯定会引起注意，就是这个高成交量区或成交量集中区。
Now, looking at the example we've got currently,

72
00:04:57,059 --> 00:05:02,306
We can see that one region we'd definitely pay attention to is this little chunk of volume,

73
00:05:02,306 --> 00:05:04,466
