74
00:05:04,470 --> 00:05:09,491
我们看到Delta在两个价格区累计达$3,600，然后能看到下一个累积区和成交量集中区，就是这里，买盘明显加大力度，接下$6,500的卖盘。
We saw a good strong delta of $3,600 being accumulated in that two price region,

75
00:05:09,491 --> 00:05:14,871
and then we can see obviously our next little region of accumulation and pocket positioning

76
00:05:14,871 --> 00:05:21,327
was this little spot here where we saw a buyer really step it up, take $6,500 that was offered.

78
00:05:21,328 --> 00:05:27,426
显然买盘吃单远超卖盘挂单。
